[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600600_04_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600600_04_0010","text":"那个……路加酱……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600600_04_0020","text":"我们要玩打西瓜，路加酱也来吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600600_04_0030","text":"哈……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600600_04_0040","text":"大家一起齐心协力使劲砸开的话，又好玩又好吃──！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600600_04_0050","text":"今年的西瓜又甜又好吃──！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600600_04_0060","text":"────……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600600_04_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600600_04_0070","text":"──路加酱，工作结束了，你还是休息一下比较好吧……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600600_04_0080","text":"这样啊──\n那等我们砸完西瓜，待会儿给你带过来"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600600_04_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600600_04_0090","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600600_04_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600600_04_0100","text":"甜的东西，我不需要"}]
